1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE 7 JUN 1790
2 PLAC Frankfurt am Main, Hessen-Nassau, Preussen
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://metahubfrankfurt.de/en/jmf/stories/rindskopf/
2 CONT
2 CONT Ber RINDSKOPF: b. ? - d.  7 June 1790, Frankfurt-am-Main
2 CONT
2 CONT Valuable details gleaned courtesy of the following website:
2 CONT
2 CONT DigiBaeck Search Results | Leo Baeck Institute
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.lbi.org/digibaeck/results/?qtype=pid&term=258967
2 CONT
2 CONT Ele Toldot ([Burial records of the Jewish community of Frankfurt am Main]), 1241-1824
2 CONT
2 CONT Ber RINDSKOPF, died 07.06.1790, buried in same grave as Sorl MENDL (schwarz. Schild)
2 CONT
2 CONT Registered: Goldstein
2 CONT
2 CONT Address: Goldene Krone
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Nem RINDSKOPF (d. 20.04.1773) z. schwz. Ring, son of Juzl
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Hindle (d. 20.08.1761), daughter of Simon OPPENHEIM
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriages:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) circa 1755: Hajhe (d. 27.05.1758), daughter of Bendit SCHIFF
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) circa 1758: Hindh of Mannheim (d. 08.06.1759), widow of Leijb of Landau, daughter of Majer RHEINGÖNNENHEIM
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) circa 1760: Rehle of Mainz (d. 07.12.1822), daughter of Josef REJNA
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Hahje, née SCHIFF
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Jendle Jentle (d. 29.02.1832) m. Joel FLASCHE (Joel FLESCH) z. Goldstein
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Rehle, née REJNA
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Juzle (Joseph) RINDSKOPF z. Kanne, d. 22.09.1847
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Meyer RINDSKOPF z. goldene Kanne, d. 13.10.1819
2 CONT
2 CONT 4) Jekkl (Jakob) RINDSKOPF z. goldene Krone, d. 21.10.1842
2 CONT
2 CONT 5) Nem RINDSKOPF of Mainz, d. 19.04.1819
2 CONT
2 CONT 6) Hinle (Henriette) (d. 26.10.1829), m. Itsek ULMAN z. Leuchte, then Juzbel (Joseph) OPPENHEIM z. Halbmond
2 CONT
2 CONT 7) Bejil (Bella) (d. 15.04.1842), m. Lejb REUSE (Löb REISS) of Taube
2 CONT
2 CONT 8) Jachebed (b. 1775), who went to Mainz where she married Isaie WESTERBURG
2 CONT
2 CONT 9) Besel (Philippine) (d. 25.01.1838), m. Lejzer (Lazarus) WEIL z. goldene Kanne
2 CONT
2 CONT 10) Hajil (Helene) (d. 15.08.1842), m. Amschel (Adolf) FLÖRSHEIM z. grünen Löwen 
2 CONT
2 CONT And also ...
2 CONT
2 CONT cf. main source cited for former son-in-law Isaac ULLMANN.
