2 NOTE Throne in the west end of the so-called Rashi Chapel, which has no associations with Rashi and was not a chapel. It was built as a study room in 1623-24 on the west side of the Alte Synagoge through the generosity of Loeb Sinzheim
3 CONC . It was reconstructed in 1854-55. Worms, Germany.
