1 NOTE Dear Alan,
2 CONT
2 CONT Here is what I have.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Rabbi Jeremiah Seckel Isak BAIERSDORF Halevi, born in1565, died  1650 in
2 CONT Vienna, Austria.  He married Ritchel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their son:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Yaakov Koppel FRAENKEL Halevi, born in 1600 in Bairsdorf, Bavaria.  He
2 CONT died on 17.4.1679 in Vienna.  He married Zortel, Zarentil, LAZARUS.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their son:
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  David Seckel (Isaac) FRAENKEL Halevi, born in Vienna, Austria.  He died
2 CONT on 4.11.1691 in Furth, Bavaria.  He married Ratisch Meyer Halevi, born 1637,
2 CONT in Vienna and died 23.1.1727.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their son:
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  Rabbi Samuel Elijah Issachar Baerman FRAENKEL Halevi, born in 1645 in
2 CONT Vienna.  He died  on 30.9.1708 in Furth, Bavaria.  He was the Chief Rabbi of
2 CONT Schnaittach, Bavaria, and Landesrabbiner of Ansbach.  He married Hannah
2 CONT GUGGENHEIM, born in1650.  She died on 2.4.1698 in Furth, Bavaria.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their son was:
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Jakob Benjamin Wolf FRAENKEL Halevi.  He married Rebecca daughter of
2 CONT Elijah SPIRA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jakob was a brother of  Treinle.  Jacob was my 6 x great grandfather!!
2 CONT
2 CONT I also have some other GUGGENHEIM family.  Eddy Guggenheim married Etta
2 CONT Goldberger.  She was my second cousin once removed!  I believe he was killed
2 CONT in a car accident in New York.  Do you know anything about him.  One of his
2 CONT daughters is called Channa!
