1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jakob KOPPEL FRAENKEL HELLER-WALLERSTEIN (b. Austria, d. 15 Sept. 1612, Vienna, Austria) married Mirl Sarah TEOMIM (b. 9 Jan. 1575, Vienna, Austria, d. 21 Feb. 1639, Vienna, Austria) daughter of Dwerl POMELITZ and 
2 CONC Meschullam Salman TEOMIM (d. 29 Aug. 1621 Vienna) son of Rebecca Sterin HOROWITZ [bat Israel HaLevi] (b. ca. 1545) and Rabbi Moses Aaron TEOMIM (b. ca. 1550 Vienna, d. 1609 Prague) son of Rabbi Simeon TEOMIM-LEMAL
2 CONT
2 CONT Jakob and Sarah had seven children together
2 CONT
2 CONT "Die Grabschriften des alten Judenfriedhof in Wien" - Dr. Bernhard Wachstein, Band I no. 52
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Rabbi Yaakov Koppel HaLevi, ABD of Neumark was son of Rabbi Aaron HaLevi Heller of Wallerstein, father of Naftali Herz (Hirsch) Koppel HaLevi, ABD of Fulda, and grandfather of Yaakov David Mirels Neumark, of Vienna.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://hebrewbooks.org/pdfpager.aspx?req=21601&st=&pgnum=335&hilite
