2 CONT /Rabbi Naftali Hirsch Halevi was ABD Fulda, son of Rabbi Yaakov Koppel HaLevi ABD of Neumark, father of Yaakov David HaLevi Mirels Neumark of Vienna, and grandfather of Binyamin Halevi Mirels Neumark, of Berlin./
