1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sarah MIRELS (b. 1670, d. 23 Jan. 1719) married (1696) Zvi Hirsh ASHKENAZI "Chaham Tzvi" (b. 1658/1660, d. 1 May 1718). She was the Grt.Grt.Grandmother of the "ADMOR of Sanz - the "Divrei Chaim".
2 CONT
2 CONT She had 15 children, the following six are:
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Rabbi Jacob EMDEN (b. 1696/1697, d. 1776) married Rachel. Sons:  Meshullam  Zalman ASHKENAZI, Meir ASHKENAZI.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Nathan ASHKENAZI
2 CONT
2 CONT     * David ASHKENAZI
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Meshulam Zalman ASHKENAZI
2 CONT
2 CONT                 + Miriam ASHKENAZI m. Aryey Leib HALBERSTAM
2 CONT
2 CONT                       # Avigdor HALBERSTAM
2 CONT
2 CONT                             ** Miriam HALBERSTAM m. the son of her cousin Aryey Leib HALBERSTAM. 
2 CONT
2 CONT                       # Haim HALBERSTAM (1792 Tarngorod - 1876) first married (1) Rachel Feige FRANKEL-TEOMIM.
2 CONT
2 CONT                         Then Haim HALBERSTAM remarried (2) his first wife's sister ??? FRANKEL-TEOMIM
2 CONT
2 CONT                         Then Haim HALBERSTAM remarried (3) Rechel Breindel TEITELBAUM. 
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Ephraim ASHKENAZI (b. 1722)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Abraham Meshulam ZALMAN ASHKENAZI
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Miriam ASHKENAZI married Arie LEIB (LOENSTEIN) (Av Beit Din) (b. 1690, d. 1755) 
2 CONT
