1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Chrzelitz book dates for this family  seem unreliable.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Chrzelitz book says that Simon Chrzelitzer a son of Bermann /Bormann married a Hulda or Taube Chrzelitzer. The marriage record of their daughter Dorel / Charlotte in 1822 puts the daughter's year of birth as 1798 and names her
2 CONC  mother as Taube widow Chrzelitzer from Schedlitz Gross Strehlitz region.
2 CONT
2 CONT The dates and places make it very unlikely that this Simon Chrzelitzer would be the son of a father who had died in Berlin in 1768.
