1 NOTE {geni:about_me} First Jewish judge in Bavaria with the title: "Oberlandesgerichtsrat"
2 CONT
2 CONT This was one of several cousin-marriages in the family:
2 CONT
2 CONT Mayer Kohn married Nanette Arnstein:
2 CONT
2 CONT Their 5th child was '''Jeanette Kohn'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Their 6th child was '''Anton Kohn'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jeanette Kohn''' married Joseph Berlin: their third child was '''Max Berlin'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Anton Kohn''' married his first cousin Kathie Arnstein (Nanette Arnstein's neice): their fourth child was '''Nanette Kohn'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Nanette Kohn''' (the progeny of a first-cousin marriage) married her own first cousin of '''Max Berlin'''. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had no children. 
