2 CONT Marriage https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000225503114023
2 CONT
2 CONT Oslov 1830 Nr 28 in Na Pazdernach - http://archivnimapy.cuzk.cz/skici/skici/PRA/PRA772018300/PRA772018300_index.html Oslov Nr 28 today - https://mapy.cz/zakladni?x=14.2113277&y=49.3975331&z=18&pano=1&pid=29640918&yaw=5.684&fov=1.2
