2 CONT Rudolph Spitz lived in Kings County, New York in 1930. He was the head of the household, 61 years old, and identified as white. Rudolph was born in Bohemia around 1869, and both of his parents were born in Bohemia as well. In 1930
2 CONC , Rudolph was married to Bella Spitz (Bela). He immigrated to the United States in 1888.
