1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *[http://jewishhistorylectures.org/2015/02/02/who-was-gluckel-of-hameln-jewish-biography-as-history-by-dr-henry-abramson/  Glückel of Hameln Lecture/Biography] Dr. Henry Abramson 
