2 CONT
2 CONT Note: [http://www.virtualjudaica.com/Item/11696/Shalmei_Nedavah virtual Judaica] ..'''Figdor''', an abbreviation of '''Avigdor''', the name of the founder of the family who lived in the small town of [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/
2 CONC Kittsee Kittsee] (Kopčany /Köpcsény), Austria after which he came to be called.." AND [http://mek.niif.hu/04000/04093/pdf/f.pdf mek.oszk.hu] '''Figdor-Kittseer''', the famous Hungarian Jewish family, which originates from Köpcsény
2 CONC  (Kittsee), near Bratislava (Presburg, Pozsony), Slovakia and the name '''Figdor''' from Avigdor who lived in Köpcsény at the beginning of the XVIIIth century. Son of '''Avigdor''', '''Jakab''' ('''Jacob''') was a Jewish-Judge in 
2 CONC the then substantial Jewish community of Köpcsény. His son Izsák (Isaac) (1768-850) founded the firm '''Figdor & Sohn''' in Vienna. Son of '''Izsák''' ('''Isaac''') '''Wühelm''' took part in the religious and charitable life of th
2 CONC e Viennese Jewish community. His son '''Gusztáv''' became a Christian and supported literary and artistic endeavours. He was a friend of Grillparzer and played a role as a town councillor of the city of Vienna. His daughter '''Emi
2 CONC lia''', is the wife of '''Mihály''' ('''Michael''') '''Hainisch'''  the president of the Austrian Republic. She was an extremely well educated and noble-minded lady, who had never hidden her Jewish origins. The pictures of her Jew
2 CONC ish ancestors still adorn the walls of her salon. The second son of '''Avigdor''' was '''Sámuel'''. His son '''Mihály''' ('''Michel Kittseer'''), who was a great scholar of the Talmud and a great benefactor, was much respected in 
2 CONC Bratislava. In 1845 he published his work ‘Salme nedovó o.’. He and his father-in-law, '''Theben Mendel''', republished his book ‘Széfet hajósor lerábcnu Tám c.’. And his son '''Viktor''' paid for the publication of the new, beaut
2 CONC iful edition of ‘Akedosz Jicchok’. '''Ignaz Figdor'''s second grandson, the world famous Art expert '''Albert Figdor''' below was the owner of the '''Figdor Collection'''. '''Wilhelm Figdor'''s grandson, '''Károly Wittgenstein''' 
2 CONC below, was the founder of the Austrian Metal industry and his son '''Pál''' was a famous Pianist. His son,''' Lajos''', was a Writer. All the '''Wittgensteins''' are Christians. ''(V. ö. Mayer, Die Wiener Juden <Jewish forum> (New
2 CONC -York 1925); Wachstein: Statuten für das Bethaus. B. S.'' OR see '''Figdor''' s in [http://books.google.ca/books?id=QQkvc_PeW7EC&pg=PA175&lpg=PA175&dq=%22Jakob+Figdor%22+OR+%22Figdor+jakob%22&source=bl&ots=2HvwvP7nai&sig=a7unjQz7O
2 CONC 95iKPme7se18LEPEBU&hl=en&ei=mKXiTK2GHoS6ngegqvT0Dw&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=1&ved=0CBUQ6AEwAA#v=snippet&q=Figdor&f=false '''Wittgenstein''' in Vienna] Book
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Die Grabschriften des alten Juedenfriedhofes in Eisenstadt - Dr. Bernhard Wachstein page 296
2 CONT
2 CONT 1700-1777 ??
