2 CONT Father: Josef ULMAN z. Strauss (d. 27.02.1791), son of Simon
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Guthal, (d. 18.10.1787), daughter of Itsek FULDA
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriages:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) 28.07.1786: Hinle (d. 26.10.1829),daughter of Ber RINDSKOPF. (The marriage was childless. Once divorced, she married Josef OPPENHEIM).
