1 NOTE {geni:about_me} My Heritage gives this information about Camelii Guggenheim:
2 CONT
2 CONT Kalmele Kalonymos Calmelli Guggenheim, 1630 - 1690 Kalmele Kalonymos Calmelli Guggenheim was born in 1630, at birth place, to Schmol Samuel Guggenheim and Merga Guggenheim. Schmol was born in 1600, in Frankfurt am Main, Frankfurt 
2 CONC am Main, Hessen, Germany. Merga was born in 1600, in Frankfurt, Darmstadt, Hesse, Germany. Kalmele had 3 siblings: Marem Guggenheim and 2 other siblings. Kalmele married Jonele Guggenheim at marriage place. Jonele was born in Stuh
2 CONC lingen, Waldshut, Baden-Württemberg, Germany. They had 7 children: Schmulin Guggenheim, Joseph Guggenheim and 5 other children. Kalmele passed away in 1690, at age 60 at death place.
