2 NOTE Date is 1579
2 NOTE The entry is about transaction between Kaile Kravová and her son-in-law Salvator Alfan. She borrowed certain sum of money from him and was supposed to repay it within 2 years. She "mortaged" or may be mada forfeitable pledge - zás
3 CONC tava (propadná zástava) / these legal terms are hard to translate. She "mortgaged" her spáleniště - place of burned-down house. I think it is safe to presume that her house burned down and she borrowed the money to rebuild it.
3 CONT And there is one more thing: the spáleniště is specified as "next to house of Vít Krava"
2 NOTE http://katalog.ahmp.cz/pragapublica/permalink?xid=E1BD2EA1B72711DF820F00166F1163D4&scan=78#scan78
