2 NOTE From: Ilona Kotyzová <kotyzova@soalitomerice.cz>
3 CONT Subject: Joseph Lewi from Auscha
3 CONT Date: November 5, 2019 at 10:36:41 PM PST
3 CONT To: randols@bslaw.net
3 CONT
3 CONT The record referring to Joseph Lewi from Auscha comes from an index book of the records of the Litomerice municipal archive. The entry in the index book survived the letter itself, unfortunately not.
3 CONT
3 CONT The archival record is very similar to a text published in the History of the Jews in Litomerice. Its author, Heinrich Ankert was my predecessor here in the Litomerice archive, and he knew its content in detail. Based on it, I wou
3 CONC ld guess that Joseph Lewi’s letter didn’t already exist in the first half of the 20th century.
3 CONT
3 CONT You can find a copy of the mentioned entry attached to this email.
3 CONT
3 CONT Best regards
3 CONT
3 CONT Ilona Kotyzová
3 CONT
3 CONT
3 CONT State District Archives Litomerice in Lovosice
3 CONT Terezinska  909/59
3 CONT CZ-410 02 Lovosice
3 CONT Czech Republic
3 CONT
3 CONT tel.: +420 477 755 922
3 CONT e-mail: kotyzova@sokalitomerice.cz
3 CONT web: http://www.soalitomerice.cz
