1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Die Familie Teomim", by Leopold Lowenstein:  "Meschullam Salman (died 1621; Wachstein No. 105), whose wife Dwerl was a daughter of Jakob Pohelitz; his son Aron (d. 1620); his son Jakob (d. 1617), husband of Bela (
2 CONC d. 1610) and then Slava, a daughter of R. Samuel Bacharach in Worms (d. 1621); his daughter Mirl, wife of the Koppel Heller Wallerstein, d. 1639 [Wachstein No. 240]." ____________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT "The Jacobi Papers":  "... eldest son, named after his mother's paternal grandfather.  In 1582, he was Rosh ve-Manhig Prague; 1591, in Vienna; 1614 "gefreiter Jud"; d. in Vienna, 1621.  He m. Dverel, dau. of R. Jacob of Polheritz 
2 CONC and Vienna."
2 CONT
