1 NOTE My 7th great grandfather.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mateles is the Polish / German of the Frankish for "the people / the descendents of God's might". Machtel / Mahtel / Majtel was a famous Jewish name under the Carolingian Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Probably a descendent of Rabbi Nathan Mateles.
2 CONT
2 CONT " Bedzin also had a large Yeshiva. The head of this institution was the very popular Rabbi Nathan Mateles. He collected money from the Jews of Bedzin and presented 50 ducats to the mayor of Bedzin to strengthen the walls of the ci
2 CONC ty against the expected attack from the forces of Maximilian the Austrian [around 1588]. The rabbi died at the age of 105, and was buried in the old cemetery in Zawale Street. "
