1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rebecca_Friedl%C3%A4nder
2 CONT
2 CONT Rebecca Friedländer was the daughter of the court jeweler Salomon Jacob (1735-1788) and Cheile Eger was well educated. 1801 she married Moses Friedländer and was divorced 1805. She converted to Christianity and she and her sisters
2 CONC  took the family name Saaling. Her pseudonym was : Regina (Regine) Frohberg.
