1 NAME Simon Selke /Tuschkau/
2 GIVN Simon Selke
2 SURN Tuschkau
2 _MARNM von Lämel
2 NICK Salkind
2 NICK Salomon Lemel
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 28 AUG 1766
2 ADDR
3 CITY Město Touškov
3 STAE Plzeň Region
3 CTRY Czech Republic
1 DEAT
2 DATE 18 APR 1845
