1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Barbara is not listed as one of Cheile's heirs...
2 CONT
2 CONT Because Babette was not her daughter. The parents of Babette are Lazar Duschenes and Anna aka Hannele and a brother Jakob Lazar Duschenes dead 1809 (Source: Georg Gaugusch Wer einmal war L - R, page 1682)
2 CONT
2 CONT Barbara (Babette) married Simon (Selke) Edler von LÄMEL in 1787, son of Lämel TUSCHKAU.  Source:  http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=lorenfamily&id=I68770
2 CONT
2 CONT "When Selke Lamel died April 18, 1845, in Vienna, he bequeathed to his widow, the former Barbara Duschenes, a sum equal to five million dollars.  His widow attained the age of 96 and upon her death the estate was divided among her
2 CONC  children. They later gave a large portion to Jewish charities and educational institutions."  From: ''The journey: the first full-length documented biography of the American-Jewish freedom fighter who rode with John Brown in Kans
2 CONC as'', Martin Litvin (1981), p. 88.  Source:  http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=lorenfamily&id=I68770
