1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Emma Gottschalk nee Weinberg was born in 08/02/1866. Prior to WWII lived in Berlin, Germany.  She was a widow Heinrich. Deported with Transport I/48 from Berlin, Germany to Theresienstadt, Ghetto, Czechoslovakia on
2 CONC  20/08/1942. Prisoner Nr. in Transport: 5015. Emma was murdered in the Shoah. Place of Death: Theresienstadt, Litomerice, Bohemia, Czechoslovakia / Terezin, Ghetto, Czechoslovakia.   Date of Death: 18/10/1942. Source: Yad Vashem.
