1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dr. Arthur Karl Heinrich Friedmann was born on 9th July 1866 in Berlin to Samuel Friedmann and his wife Agnes. He converted to Catholicism. On January 26, 1895 Arthur Karl Heinrich passed his exam as an oculist. In
2 CONC  1899 he moved to the USA. In 1916 he came back to Germany. In 1917 he came to Altenburg (former Duchy of Saxe-Altenburg, now Thuringia) and opened a oculist´s office. He later was manager of the medical society of Altenburg. In 1
2 CONC 934/1935 the family emigrated to Switzerland.
