2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_Mansfield
2 CONT
2 CONT "His parents were Hermine Küchenmeister-Rudersdorf, a Russian-born operatic soprano, and Maurice Mansfield, a British London-based wine merchant (died 1861). His grandfather was the violinist Joseph Rudersdorff.[1][2]"
2 CONT
